{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-7-39","kind":"proposition","title":"构造与求解：整数","englishTitle":"To find the number which is the least that will have given parts.","book":7,"number":39,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.39","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.39/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":39,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-7-39@raw-c5955827dc047ba4","contentId":"euclid-7-39","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c5955827dc047ba4a8b570cf8904b94a177d6e12b840befa29fdf0456d2adcb6","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-7-39.statement","euclid-7-39.construction.1","euclid-7-39.construction.2","euclid-7-39.proof.1","euclid-7-39.proof.2","euclid-7-39.proof.3","euclid-7-39.proof.4","euclid-7-39.construction.3","euclid-7-39.proof.5","euclid-7-39.proof.6","euclid-7-39.proof.7","euclid-7-39.conclusion","euclid-7-39.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-7-39.statement","contentId":"euclid-7-39","revisionId":"euclid-7-39@raw-c5955827dc047ba4","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cd58cdc77aea10f857fcf9b850851d65d545d60ce3fef56dc9562375c528d630","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To find the number which is the least that will have given parts."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"找到最小的分数"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-39.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-7-39","revisionId":"euclid-7-39@raw-c5955827dc047ba4","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9118d1667596fd14f60c98aaf66cd844fe31264759ceb43e4f8d4740840fd2a9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let A, B, C be the given parts; thus it is required to find the number which is the least that will have the parts A, B, C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让A、B、C部件成为给定部件;因此,需要找到最少的A、B、C部件。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-39.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-7-39","revisionId":"euclid-7-39@raw-c5955827dc047ba4","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8325e3b5ef962b2e67a40949491d4b61b451a79cef28d0d50fdbe1cc5503d296","citations":["euclid-7-36"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let D, E, F be numbers called by the same name as the parts A, B, C, and let G, the least number measured by D, E, F, be taken. [[VII. 36](/principles/euclid-7-36)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让D,E,F编号与第A、B、C零件相同,G码最低为D,E,F码。 [[VII. 36](/principles/euclid-7-36)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-39.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-7-39","revisionId":"euclid-7-39@raw-c5955827dc047ba4","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5f0c1dc4205c124bcd94eff6d73f8fe918614324af33d3889df31b939489b9f1","citations":["euclid-7-37"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore G has parts called by the same name as D, E, F. [[VII. 37](/principles/euclid-7-37)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,G部件的名称与D、E、F相同。 [[VII. 37](/principles/euclid-7-37)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-39.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-7-39","revisionId":"euclid-7-39@raw-c5955827dc047ba4","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ef702ebe4845cb6675ccc059f896a73051729df6361668b2f07fbbdaf3558b40","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But A, B, C are parts called by the same name as D, E, F; therefore G has the parts A, B, C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但A、B、C部件的名称与D、E、F相同;因此,G部件的名称是A、B、C。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-39.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-7-39","revisionId":"euclid-7-39@raw-c5955827dc047ba4","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"12848673102ba601b29156bfd139ce9764ef52b61a44f6c355a39562dbf352a5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that it is also the least number that has."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我接下来说,这也是数量最少的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-39.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-7-39","revisionId":"euclid-7-39@raw-c5955827dc047ba4","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a0d4c57992a7d7741b24797be4e4fe32624308a0646375e4294419206dbd0828","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if not, there will be some number less than G which will have the parts A, B, C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"否则,将有不到G部分,即A、B、C部分。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-39.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-7-39","revisionId":"euclid-7-39@raw-c5955827dc047ba4","order":7,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c7c80b226b37d498f8e9863c082ef3d15e664fe3d1d5e929c1f4dcea3a3fc252","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let it be H."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"H块吧"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-39.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-7-39","revisionId":"euclid-7-39@raw-c5955827dc047ba4","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"31668950b10b57a86480a185dd25ab0f30733fa7bd7b34cee388dc514edf5815","citations":["euclid-7-38"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since H has the parts A, B, C, therefore H will be measured by numbers called by the same name as the parts A, B, C. [[VII. 38](/principles/euclid-7-38)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于H部件有A、B、C部件,因此H将用与A、B、C部件名称相同的数字计量。 [[VII. 38](/principles/euclid-7-38)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-39.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-7-39","revisionId":"euclid-7-39@raw-c5955827dc047ba4","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d463e48f732fa3f16b072d7ea3c5c07c9c263b2230fc340d3111be49c7cdc068","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But D, E, F are numbers called by the same name as the parts A, B, C; therefore H is measured by D, E, F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但D,E,F是A,B,C零件的同名号码,因此H是D,E,F。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-39.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-7-39","revisionId":"euclid-7-39@raw-c5955827dc047ba4","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2388b4d8fa652512cdc4685c66cf768fffe6be6f4296f1007a2b509cea98ad58","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it is less than G : which is impossible."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"不到G,这是不可能的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-39.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-7-39","revisionId":"euclid-7-39@raw-c5955827dc047ba4","order":11,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2ecb70c75c65ffa502b6ad475847c5b04138b56582a901621c66fc630333e971","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore there will be no number less than G that will have the parts A, B, C. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,将不少于G部分的编号,即A、B、C、Q、E、D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-39.source","contentId":"euclid-7-39","revisionId":"euclid-7-39@raw-c5955827dc047ba4","order":12,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7cc9f655c4d30b3a72849b3d642266263da82ddd45737374bcf6b2f48ef0b0e7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.39/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.39\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-7-39:euclid-7-36:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-7-39","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-7-39.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-36","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.39","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.39/","sourceLabel":"VII. 36"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-7-39:euclid-7-37:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-7-39","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-7-39.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-37","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn: